          <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>Bei gani?</strong></td><td>BAY-ee GAH-nee</td><td>How much? (Price what?)</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Ghali sana</strong></td><td>GHAH-lee SAH-nah</td><td>Too expensive</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Punguza bei</strong></td><td>poon-goo-ZAH BAY-ee</td><td>Lower the price</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Nitakupatia...</strong></td><td>nee-tah-koo-pah-TEE-ah</td><td>I'll give you... (my offer)</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Nitachukua</strong></td><td>nee-tah-choo-KOO-ah</td><td>I'll take it</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Sitachukua</strong></td><td>see-tah-choo-KOO-ah</td><td>I won't take it</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Ninaweza kulipa kadi?</strong></td><td>nee-nah-WEH-zah koo-LEE-pah KAH-dee</td><td>Can I pay by card?</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Nipe resiti</strong></td><td>NEE-peh reh-SEE-tee</td><td>Give me a receipt</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Bei ya mwisho</strong></td><td>BAY-ee yah MEE-sho</td><td>Final price / Best price</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        
        <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem;background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #4caf50;margin:1.5rem 0;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;">💡 Bargaining Etiquette</h3>
          <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.25rem;">
            <li>Start at 50–60% of asking price</li>
            <li>Smile, joke, take your time — it's a social dance</li>
            <li>Walk away if needed — they'll often call you back</li>
            <li>Don't bargain for food staples or fixed-price shops</li>
            <li>Pay fairly — a few thousand TZS matters more to them than you</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

