      <section>
        <h2>🕌 Cultural Etiquette — Do's & Don'ts</h2>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin:1.5rem 0;">
          <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #4caf50;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#2e7d32;">✅ Do</h3>
            <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.25rem;">
              <li>Greet everyone with "Habari"</li>
              <li>Use right hand for eating/giving/receiving</li>
              <li>Dress modestly (shoulders/knees covered) in Stone Town & villages</li>
              <li>Remove shoes entering homes/mosques</li>
              <li>Ask permission before photographing people</li>
              <li>Accept tea/food offered — refusing is rude</li>
              <li>Learn basic greetings — it shows respect</li>
              <li>Haggle with a smile</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #f44336;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#c62828;">❌ Don't</h3>
            <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.25rem;">
              <li>Skip greetings — ever</li>
              <li>Use left hand for eating/giving</li>
              <li>Wear bikinis/short shorts in Stone Town/villages</li>
              <li>Point at people with finger</li>
              <li>Photograph women without permission</li>
              <li>Public displays of affection</li>
              <li>Drink alcohol openly in villages</li>
              <li>Step on prayer mats / enter mosques during prayer</li>
              <li>Give money to begging children (creates dependency)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h3>🕌 Mosque Etiquette</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Non-Muslims: visit outside prayer times only</li>
          <li>Remove shoes at entrance</li>
          <li>Women: cover hair, arms, legs (bring a scarf)</li>
          <li>Men: long pants, no sleeveless shirts</li>
          <li>Speak quietly; no photos during prayer</li>
          <li>Friday midday: main weekly prayer — avoid visits</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h3>🎁 Gift Giving</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Small gifts for hosts/guides: local coffee, spices, postcards from home</li>
          <li>Don't give sweets to children (dental care limited)</li>
          <li>School supplies (pens, notebooks) appreciated if visiting schools</li>
          <li>Give with right hand (or both hands)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

